      "player": "o3 Vorthos",
      "decision_index": 34,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Playing Domesticated Hydra uses 4 mana to deploy a single 3/3, leaving 1 Mountain unused. The alternative of Fertilid (2G) + Dragon Fodder (1R) uses all 5 mana, deploys three bodies (2/2 + two 1/1s), provides future ramp via Fertilid's ability, and critically sets up Volley Veteran for next turn to enter dealing 2+ damage (with Goblins on board).",
      "action_taken": "Cast Domesticated Hydra for a single 3/3 body, wasting 1 mana.",
      "better_line": "Cast Fertilid (2G) then Dragon Fodder (1R) to deploy three creatures, use all mana efficiently, enable ramp, and set up Volley Veteran's Goblin synergy for the following turn.",
