    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Casting Volley Veteran with no other Goblins on the board means its ETB only deals 1 damage, which can't kill either Gnawing Zombie (1/3) or Tree of Perdition (0/13). Playing Dragon Fodder + Fertilid this turn (total 5 mana) would develop the board and set up Volley Veteran next turn to deal 3 damage (2 Goblin tokens + itself), enough to kill Gnawing Zombie.",
      "action_taken": "Cast Volley Veteran as the first creature, wasting most of its ETB damage potential (only 1 damage).",
      "better_line": "Cast Dragon Fodder ({1}{R}) and Fertilid ({2}{G}) this turn to develop the board. Next turn, play Forest from hand and cast Volley Veteran for 3 damage ETB (3 Goblins), killing Gnawing Zombie.",
      "type": "blunder",
