      "decision_index": 44,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Casting Exsanguinate before activating Tree of Perdition is a sequencing error. Tree swaps the opponent's life total with its toughness (13). If Tree activates first (opponent 17→13, Tree becomes 0/17), then Exsanguinate for X=2 puts opponent to 11. If Exsanguinate resolves first (opponent 17→15), then Tree swaps 15↔13, putting opponent to 13 and Tree to 0/15. The Tree-first line deals 2 more damage and leaves Tree with 2 more toughness for future exchanges.",
      "action_taken": "Cast Exsanguinate before activating Tree of Perdition",
      "better_line": "Play Thriving Moor, activate Tree of Perdition (opponent 17→13, Tree becomes 0/17), then cast Exsanguinate for X=2 (opponent 13→11, you gain 2 life)",
      "type": "blunder",
      "snapshot_index": 136,
      "player": "o3 Vorthos",
      "decision_index": 47,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Targeted themselves with Gnawing Zombie's drain ability instead of the opponent. The ability reads 'Target player loses 1 life and you gain 1 life' - targeting yourself nets zero (lose 1, gain 1), while targeting the opponent would drain them for 1 and gain you 1 life, a 2-point life swing.",
      "action_taken": "Targeted o3 Vorthos (self) with Gnawing Zombie's ability, resulting in net zero life change.",
      "better_line": "Target GLM47 Timmy with the Gnawing Zombie ability to drain 1 life from the opponent and gain 1 life.",
      "type": "blunder",
      "snapshot_index": 140,
      "player": "o3 Vorthos",
      "decision_index": 52,
