    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Casting Volley Veteran without first casting Dragon Fodder means Volley Veteran's ETB only deals 1 damage (counting itself) instead of 3 damage (2 Goblin tokens + itself). With 6 lands (4 Forest, 2 Mountain), both Dragon Fodder (1R) and Volley Veteran (3R) could be cast this turn. The extra 2 damage to Tree of Perdition (reducing it from 0/16 to 0/13 instead of 0/15) matters significantly against this threatening creature.",
      "action_taken": "Cast Volley Veteran first, dealing only 1 damage to Tree of Perdition with its ETB trigger.",
