    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "GLM47 timed out and passed their precombat main phase with 6 untapped lands and two castable creatures (Domesticated Hydra and Fertilid) in hand. This wastes an entire turn of development against a threatening board featuring Tree of Perdition. They also could have followed up with Dragon Fodder to start building toward their Goblin Grenade/Volley Veteran synergy.",
