      "decision_index": 58,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Declined to activate Fertilid's ramp ability when it was the only available action and they have expensive cards in hand (Domesticated Hydra, Volley Veteran, Hunter's Edge). Getting an extra land would help deploy these threats faster. Fertilid is summoning sick so can't attack anyway, and the +1/+1 counter removal is a small cost given the mana acceleration benefit.",
