      "decision_index": 61,
    },
    {
      "severity": "major",
      "description": "The opponent is at exactly 13 life. Casting Triskaidekaphobia (4 mana, easily castable) would threaten to kill the opponent at the next upkeep trigger if they can't change their life total. Instead, Exsanguinate for X=3 drops the opponent to 10 life, moving them OFF the critical 13 life threshold and wasting the Triskaidekaphobia combo. Tree of Perdition (currently 0/16) could later be used to reset the opponent to 13 or 16, but this requires extra steps.",
      "action_taken": "Cast Exsanguinate for X=3, dealing 3 damage and moving opponent from 13 to 10 life.",
