      "player": "o3 Vorthos",
      "decision_index": 69,
    },
    {
      "severity": "major",
      "description": "The opponent is at exactly 13 life with Triskaidekaphobia about to resolve as an enchantment. On o3 Vorthos's next upkeep, Triskaidekaphobia would trigger and the opponent at 13 life would lose the game. By activating Tree of Perdition, o3 Vorthos exchanged the opponent's 13 life with Tree's 16 toughness, moving the opponent to 16 life and completely negating the Triskaidekaphobia kill.",
