    {
      "severity": "major",
      "description": "GLM47 timed out and took no action in their precombat main phase with 7 mana available and 6 castable spells in hand. The opponent has the Tree of Perdition + Triskaidekaphobia combo threatening to kill them (Tree untaps next turn, swaps life to 13, Triskaidekaphobia kills at 13 life). Wasting this turn is potentially game-losing as it gives the opponent time to execute their combo without any board pressure or development from GLM47.",
      "action_taken": "No response (timeout) — passed priority without casting anything despite having 7 mana and multiple strong plays available.",
      "better_line": "Cast Dragon Fodder (2 mana) to create two Goblin tokens, then cast Volley Veteran (4 mana) dealing 3 damage to a creature (3 Goblins on board). This builds a threatening board with Goblin Grenade available next turn for 5 damage to the opponent's face, and creates pressure to race the combo. Alternatively, cast Domesticated Hydra as a strong body alongside Dragon Fodder.",
      "type": "blunder",
