    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Fertilid can attack for 1 damage completely unblocked — Tree of Perdition is tapped, there are no other creatures on opponent's side, and all opponent's lands are tapped. With Triskaidekaphobia on the battlefield making life totals critically important, every point of damage matters. There is zero risk to attacking.",
