      "decision_index": 74,
    },
    {
      "severity": "major",
      "description": "The opponent has the Tree of Perdition + Triskaidekaphobia combo threatening lethal. Casting Domesticated Hydra does nothing to address this. With Dragon Fodder + Goblin Grenade targeting Tree of Perdition (5 damage, reducing it to 0/8), the combo becomes much less threatening. Adding Hunter's Edge (Fertilid fights Tree for 2 more, Tree to 0/6) uses all 7 mana and severely cripples the combo. Ignoring the combo is likely game-losing.",
      "action_taken": "Cast Domesticated Hydra, a vanilla 3/3 that doesn't address the lethal Tree of Perdition + Triskaidekaphobia combo.",
      "better_line": "Dragon Fodder (1R) + Goblin Grenade targeting Tree of Perdition for 5 damage (R, sac goblin token) + Hunter's Edge putting counter on Fertilid to fight Tree for 2 more damage (3G). Uses all 7 mana, reduces Tree to 0/6, and severely weakens the combo while still having a goblin token and buffed Fertilid on board.",
      "type": "blunder",
      "snapshot_index": 199,
