    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Failed to activate Fertilid's last +1/+1 counter ability to fetch a basic land. Fertilid as a 1/1 body is nearly irrelevant, and the extra land ramp would help power up Domesticated Hydra's monstrosity ability in future turns. With the Triskaidekaphobia/Tree of Perdition combo threatening, having more mana available is important.",
