    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Exsanguinate is unnecessary here. The Tree of Perdition + Triskaidekaphobia combo already provides a guaranteed kill: activate Tree to set opponent to 13 life, then Triskaidekaphobia kills them at the next upkeep. Casting Exsanguinate wastes a card that could serve as a backup win condition if something goes wrong.",
