    {
      "severity": "major",
      "description": "GLM47 Timmy is at exactly 13 life with Triskaidekaphobia on the opponent's battlefield. On the opponent's next upkeep, Triskaidekaphobia will check and GLM47 will lose the game for having exactly 13 life. Playing Servant of the Scale does nothing to change their life total.",
