      "severity": "major",
      "description": "GLM47 is at exactly 13 life with opponent's Triskaidekaphobia on board, meaning they will lose the game at the opponent's next upkeep. Hydra's Growth is a slow enchantment that provides no immediate impact. The player needs to either change their life total or attempt to win this turn. While winning this turn appears very difficult (only ~5 attack damage available plus Volley Veteran ETB vs opponent's 15 life), casting a slow aura guarantees wasting the mana on something irrelevant.",
